@lang en
IMPORT `bvvcx-claim`

-- Layer 2: how much is payable? Every expected value worked by hand from Articles 10.2,
-- 12-15 and Part IV before it was written here. The standard case (bvvcx-tests-fixtures.l4):
-- a door repaired for 8,000,000 and a bumper replaced for 10,000,000 on a car 48 months in
-- use (15% depreciation: 8,500,000), so the reasonable cost is 16,500,000; insured at value;
-- the 14.3 deductible of 500,000 applies.

§ `Tests — a partial loss`

#ASSERT `the amount payable on` `the standard claim` EQUALS 16_000_000
#ASSERT `the settlement of` `the standard claim` EQUALS `a covered loss settled as` `10.1.1 collision, overturning, toppling, loss of balance, sinking, falling, or being struck from outside` `a partial loss (13.1)` 16_000_000 0 0
#ASSERT `13.1.1 — who is paid for a partial loss` TRUE EQUALS `the repairer`
#ASSERT `13.1.1 — who is paid for a partial loss` FALSE EQUALS `the insured`
#ASSERT `13.3.1 — the insurer takes back the damaged part` `a bumper replaced for 10 million`
#ASSERT NOT `13.3.1 — the insurer takes back the damaged part` `a door repaired for 8 million`

§§ `Depreciation by time in use (13.1.2(b)), through the whole claim`

GIVEN `the year` IS A NUMBER
      `the month` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A claim`
`the standard collision of a car registered in` `the year` `,` `the month` MEANS
    `a claim: vehicle` (`a used car worth 600 million, registered` (`registered in` `the year` `,` `the month`) `, made in` (`the year` MINUS 1))
        `, policy` `the standard policy` `, claimant` `the insured named on the certificate`
        `, event` `the standard collision` `, driving` `the standard driving` `, conduct` `prompt and proper conduct`
        `, shortfall` `no premium shortfall` `, costs` `no costs` `, hire` NOTHING `, wreck` `no wreck kept` `, other insurance` EMPTY

-- February 2023 to January 2026 is 35 months: 0%, so 8m + 10m - 0.5m.
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`the standard collision of a car registered in` 2023 `,` 2) EQUALS 17_500_000
-- 48 months: 15%. 72 months: 25% (8m + 7.5m - 0.5m). 120 months: 35%. 180 months: 50%.
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`the standard collision of a car registered in` 2022 `,` 1) EQUALS 16_000_000
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`the standard collision of a car registered in` 2020 `,` 1) EQUALS 15_000_000
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`the standard collision of a car registered in` 2016 `,` 1) EQUALS 14_000_000
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`the standard collision of a car registered in` 2011 `,` 1) EQUALS 12_500_000

§§ `Below value (13.1.2(a)), BVVC06, BVVC01, the deductible (14)`

GIVEN `the policy` IS A `The policy`
GIVETH A `A claim`
`the standard collision under` `the policy` MEANS
    `a standard claim under` `the policy` `for` `the standard collision` `,` `the standard driving`

-- Sum insured 480m of a 600m value: 16.5m x 0.8 - 0.5m.
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`the standard collision under` (`a 2026 policy with sum insured` 480_000_000 `, deductible` NOTHING `, clauses` EMPTY)) EQUALS 12_700_000
-- BVVC06 cancels the pro-rating.
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`the standard collision under` (`a 2026 policy with sum insured` 480_000_000 `, deductible` NOTHING `, clauses` (LIST `BVVC06 (settlement up to the limit of liability)`))) EQUALS 16_000_000
-- BVVC01: no depreciation, 8m + 10m - 0.5m.
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`the standard collision under` (`the standard policy with` (LIST `BVVC01 (no deduction for depreciation)`))) EQUALS 17_500_000
-- A deductible of 2m on the certificate; one of 300,000 (below the 14.3 minimum, fork F35).
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`the standard collision under` (`a 2026 policy with sum insured` 600_000_000 `, deductible` (JUST 2_000_000) `, clauses` EMPTY)) EQUALS 14_500_000
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`the standard collision under` (`a 2026 policy with sum insured` 600_000_000 `, deductible` (JUST 300_000) `, clauses` EMPTY)) EQUALS 16_200_000
-- 14.2: a loss at the deductible pays nothing; just above it pays the excess.
#ASSERT `14.2 — the compensation from a loss of` 500_000 `under a deductible of` 500_000 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `14.2 — the compensation from a loss of` 500_001 `under a deductible of` 500_000 EQUALS 1
-- 12.1: a sum insured above the value is not settled by the Rules.
#ASSERT REFUSED `the amount payable on` (`the standard collision under` (`a 2026 policy with sum insured` 700_000_000 `, deductible` NOTHING `, clauses` EMPTY)) BECAUSE "the sum insured exceeds the value, which 12.1 forbids, and the Rules do not say how such a contract is settled"

§§ `Paint (13.1.3)`

GIVEN `the share` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A claim`
`the standard collision, with paint damage over` `the share` MEANS
    `a standard claim for` `the event`
    WHERE
        `the event` MEANS
            `an event on` (YMD 2026 6 15) `: peril` `a collision` `, sudden` TRUE `, at` `in Vietnam` `, war` FALSE `, deliberate` EMPTY
                `, hired out` FALSE `, inspection` `a valid inspection certificate` `, load` `a normal load` `, parts` `the standard parts`
                `, paint` (JUST `the paint`) `, police suspension` FALSE `, earlier part thefts` 0
        `the paint` MEANS
            `The paint damage` WITH `share of the painted area damaged` IS `the share`, `cost of repainting the whole vehicle` IS 30_000_000, `cost of repainting the damaged area only` IS 12_000_000

-- Over half: the whole vehicle is repainted (30m); exactly half: the damaged area (12m).
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`the standard collision, with paint damage over` 0.6) EQUALS 46_000_000
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`the standard collision, with paint damage over` 0.5) EQUALS 28_000_000

§ `Tests — reductions (Article 15)`

GIVEN `hours`     IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `days`      IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `fm`        IS A BOOLEAN
      `moved`     IS A BOOLEAN
      `safety`    IS A BOOLEAN
      `repaired`  IS A BOOLEAN
      `dishonest` IS A BOOLEAN
      `rate`      IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A `A claim`
`the standard collision; told after` `hours` `hours, written notice after` `days` `days; force majeure` `fm` `; moved` `moved` `; for safety` `safety` `; repaired` `repaired` `; dishonest` `dishonest` `; rate` `rate` MEANS
    `the standard collision, with conduct` (`conduct: told after hours` `hours` `, written notice after days` `days` `, force majeure` `fm` `, moved without consent` `moved` `, for safety` `safety` `, repaired without consent` `repaired` `, dishonest` `dishonest` `, 15.1.3 rate` `rate`)

-- 15.1.1(a): 7 hours, 10% (16.5m x 0.9 - 0.5m); exactly 6 hours, none.
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`the standard collision; told after` (JUST 7) `hours, written notice after` (JUST 2) `days; force majeure` FALSE `; moved` FALSE `; for safety` FALSE `; repaired` FALSE `; dishonest` FALSE `; rate` NOTHING) EQUALS 14_350_000
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`the standard collision; told after` (JUST 6) `hours, written notice after` (JUST 2) `days; force majeure` FALSE `; moved` FALSE `; for safety` FALSE `; repaired` FALSE `; dishonest` FALSE `; rate` NOTHING) EQUALS 16_000_000
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`the standard collision; told after` NOTHING `hours, written notice after` (JUST 2) `days; force majeure` FALSE `; moved` FALSE `; for safety` FALSE `; repaired` FALSE `; dishonest` FALSE `; rate` NOTHING) EQUALS 14_350_000
-- 15.1.1(b): written notice after 6 days, 10%; after 5, none; after 6 under force majeure, none.
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`the standard collision; told after` (JUST 1) `hours, written notice after` (JUST 6) `days; force majeure` FALSE `; moved` FALSE `; for safety` FALSE `; repaired` FALSE `; dishonest` FALSE `; rate` NOTHING) EQUALS 14_350_000
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`the standard collision; told after` (JUST 1) `hours, written notice after` (JUST 5) `days; force majeure` FALSE `; moved` FALSE `; for safety` FALSE `; repaired` FALSE `; dishonest` FALSE `; rate` NOTHING) EQUALS 16_000_000
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`the standard collision; told after` (JUST 1) `hours, written notice after` (JUST 6) `days; force majeure` TRUE `; moved` FALSE `; for safety` FALSE `; repaired` FALSE `; dishonest` FALSE `; rate` NOTHING) EQUALS 16_000_000
-- 15.1.1(c): moved from the scene without consent, 10%; moved for safety, none.
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`the standard collision; told after` (JUST 1) `hours, written notice after` (JUST 2) `days; force majeure` FALSE `; moved` TRUE `; for safety` FALSE `; repaired` FALSE `; dishonest` FALSE `; rate` NOTHING) EQUALS 14_350_000
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`the standard collision; told after` (JUST 1) `hours, written notice after` (JUST 2) `days; force majeure` FALSE `; moved` TRUE `; for safety` TRUE `; repaired` FALSE `; dishonest` FALSE `; rate` NOTHING) EQUALS 16_000_000
-- 15.1.2(a): repaired without consent, 25% (16.5m x 0.75 - 0.5m).
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`the standard collision; told after` (JUST 1) `hours, written notice after` (JUST 2) `days; force majeure` FALSE `; moved` FALSE `; for safety` FALSE `; repaired` TRUE `; dishonest` FALSE `; rate` NOTHING) EQUALS 11_875_000
-- 15.2: 10% and 25% together, the higher only.
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`the standard collision; told after` (JUST 7) `hours, written notice after` (JUST 2) `days; force majeure` FALSE `; moved` FALSE `; for safety` FALSE `; repaired` TRUE `; dishonest` FALSE `; rate` NOTHING) EQUALS 11_875_000
#ASSERT count (`15.1 — the reductions that apply to` (`the standard collision; told after` (JUST 7) `hours, written notice after` (JUST 2) `days; force majeure` FALSE `; moved` FALSE `; for safety` FALSE `; repaired` TRUE `; dishonest` FALSE `; rate` NOTHING)) EQUALS 2
-- 15.1.3: dishonesty, the insurer fixing 40% (16.5m x 0.6 - 0.5m); fixing nothing, declined.
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`the standard collision; told after` (JUST 1) `hours, written notice after` (JUST 2) `days; force majeure` FALSE `; moved` FALSE `; for safety` FALSE `; repaired` FALSE `; dishonest` TRUE `; rate` (JUST 0.4)) EQUALS 9_400_000
#ASSERT REFUSED `the amount payable on` (`the standard collision; told after` (JUST 1) `hours, written notice after` (JUST 2) `days; force majeure` FALSE `; moved` FALSE `; for safety` FALSE `; repaired` FALSE `; dishonest` TRUE `; rate` NOTHING) BECAUSE "a ground of 15.1.3 applies and the insurer has fixed no rate for it"
#ASSERT REFUSED `the amount payable on` (`the standard collision; told after` (JUST 1) `hours, written notice after` (JUST 2) `days; force majeure` FALSE `; moved` FALSE `; for safety` FALSE `; repaired` FALSE `; dishonest` TRUE `; rate` (JUST 1.5)) BECAUSE "the rate the insurer fixed under 15.1.3 is outside 0% to 100%"

