        (`driven by` `a sober licensed driver with consent` `,` (`driving: wrong way` FALSE `, disobeyed signals` FALSE `, racing` FALSE `, dangerous goods` FALSE `, parked at a no-parking sign` FALSE `, speed excess` `the excess`))

