#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`the standard collision, with premium shortfall` (`a shortfall: misdeclared` FALSE `, risk increase not told` TRUE `, paid` 9_000_000 `, due` (JUST 12_000_000))) EQUALS 11_875_000
