§ `Tests — a total loss (13.2)`

`an engine replaced for 300 million` MEANS `a part replaced:` "engine" `, of kind` `the engine` `, caused by` `the insured event itself` `, for` 300_000_000

GIVEN `the cost` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A damaged part`
`body work repaired for` `the cost` MEANS `a part repaired:` "body" `, of kind` `an ordinary part of the vehicle` `, caused by` `the insured event itself` `, for` `the cost`

GIVEN `the body work` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A claim`
`a collision wrecking the engine (300m new) with body work of` `the body work` MEANS
    `a standard claim for` (`a sudden` `a collision` `on 15 June 2026, damaging` (LIST `an engine replaced for 300 million`, `body work repaired for` `the body work`))

-- 255m (300m less 15%) + 200m = 455m, more than 75% of the 580m market value (435m): a total
-- loss, paid at market value, no deductible.
#ASSERT `the kind of loss in` (`a collision wrecking the engine (300m new) with body work of` 200_000_000) EQUALS `a total loss by the cost of repair (13.2.1(a))`
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`a collision wrecking the engine (300m new) with body work of` 200_000_000) EQUALS 580_000_000
-- 255m + 180m = 435m exactly: not more than 75%, so a partial loss: 435m - 0.5m.
#ASSERT `the kind of loss in` (`a collision wrecking the engine (300m new) with body work of` 180_000_000) EQUALS `a partial loss (13.1)`
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`a collision wrecking the engine (300m new) with body work of` 180_000_000) EQUALS 434_500_000

GIVEN `the policy`    IS A `The policy`
      `the salvage`   IS A `The salvage`
      `the hours`     IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A claim`
`a total loss under` `the policy` `, wreck` `the salvage` `, insurer told after this many hours:` `the hours` MEANS
    `a claim: vehicle` `the standard vehicle` `, policy` `the policy` `, claimant` `the insured named on the certificate`
        `, event` `the event` `, driving` `the standard driving`
        `, conduct` (`conduct: told after hours` (JUST `the hours`) `, written notice after days` (JUST 2) `, force majeure` FALSE `, moved without consent` FALSE `, for safety` FALSE `, repaired without consent` FALSE `, dishonest` FALSE `, 15.1.3 rate` NOTHING)
        `, shortfall` `no premium shortfall` `, costs` `no costs` `, hire` NOTHING `, wreck` `the salvage` `, other insurance` EMPTY
    WHERE
        `the event` MEANS
            `a sudden` `a collision` `on 15 June 2026, damaging` (LIST `an engine replaced for 300 million`, `body work repaired for` 200_000_000)

`the insured keeps the wreck, valued at 50 million` MEANS `The salvage` WITH
    `the insured asks to keep the vehicle after a total loss`  IS TRUE
    `the salvage value as the insurer values it`               IS JUST 50_000_000

-- Keeping the wreck: 580m - 50m. Below value (480m of 600m): 13.2.2 pays the sum insured
-- (no pro-rating), and the wreck deduction is the insurer's 80% share, 40m.
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`a total loss under` `the standard policy` `, wreck` `the insured keeps the wreck, valued at 50 million` `, insurer told after this many hours:` 1) EQUALS 530_000_000
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`a total loss under` (`a 2026 policy with sum insured` 480_000_000 `, deductible` NOTHING `, clauses` EMPTY) `, wreck` `no wreck kept` `, insurer told after this many hours:` 1) EQUALS 480_000_000
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`a total loss under` (`a 2026 policy with sum insured` 480_000_000 `, deductible` NOTHING `, clauses` EMPTY) `, wreck` `the insured keeps the wreck, valued at 50 million` `, insurer told after this many hours:` 1) EQUALS 440_000_000
-- A total loss told late: 580m x 0.9.
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`a total loss under` `the standard policy` `, wreck` `no wreck kept` `, insurer told after this many hours:` 7) EQUALS 522_000_000
-- BVVC06: a total loss is paid the sum insured.
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`a total loss under` (`a 2026 policy with sum insured` 480_000_000 `, deductible` NOTHING `, clauses` (LIST `BVVC06 (settlement up to the limit of liability)`)) `, wreck` `no wreck kept` `, insurer told after this many hours:` 1) EQUALS 480_000_000

