#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`a theft of the whole vehicle, the police having suspended the case:` FALSE) EQUALS 0

§ `Tests — Part IV amounts`

§§ `BVVC03: flood`

GIVEN `the peril`   IS A `A peril`
      `the parts`   IS A LIST OF `A damaged part`
      `the clauses` IS A LIST OF `A supplementary clause`
GIVETH A `A claim`
`a sudden` `the peril` `damaging` `the parts` `, under clauses` `the clauses` MEANS
    `a standard claim under` (`the standard policy with` `the clauses`) `for` (`a sudden` `the peril` `on 15 June 2026, damaging` `the parts`) `,` `the standard driving`

`an engine drowned while driving, repaired for 40 million` MEANS `a part repaired:` "engine" `, of kind` `the engine` `, caused by` `water, while the vehicle was operating in a flooded area` `, for` 40_000_000
`an engine drowned while parked, repaired for 40 million` MEANS `a part repaired:` "engine" `, of kind` `the engine` `, caused by` `water, while the vehicle was not operating` `, for` 40_000_000
`an engine drowned while driving, repaired for 20 million` MEANS `a part repaired:` "engine" `, of kind` `the engine` `, caused by` `water, while the vehicle was operating in a flooded area` `, for` 20_000_000

-- Flooding under BVVC03: 40m less the flood deductible (10%, 4m) less 0.5m; 20m less the
-- floor of 3m, less 0.5m.
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`a sudden` `flooding in rain, storm or flood` `damaging` (LIST `an engine drowned while driving, repaired for 40 million`) `, under clauses` (LIST `BVVC03 (flood damage)`)) EQUALS 35_500_000
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`a sudden` `flooding in rain, storm or flood` `damaging` (LIST `an engine drowned while driving, repaired for 20 million`) `, under clauses` (LIST `BVVC03 (flood damage)`)) EQUALS 16_500_000
-- A catastrophe while driving: without BVVC03 the engine is excluded (11.12) and nothing is
-- paid; with it, as above.
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`a sudden` `a natural catastrophe beyond human control` `damaging` (LIST `an engine drowned while driving, repaired for 40 million`) `, under clauses` EMPTY) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`a sudden` `a natural catastrophe beyond human control` `damaging` (LIST `an engine drowned while driving, repaired for 40 million`) `, under clauses` (LIST `BVVC03 (flood damage)`)) EQUALS 35_500_000
-- A catastrophe while parked: covered by 10.1.3 without BVVC03; the base deductible only.
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`a sudden` `a natural catastrophe beyond human control` `damaging` (LIST `an engine drowned while parked, repaired for 40 million`) `, under clauses` EMPTY) EQUALS 39_500_000

§§ `BVVC04: theft of parts`

