-- 2m) less 0.5m; the remote control is not paid for.
`a mirror stolen` MEANS `a part replaced:` "wing mirror" `, of kind` `an ordinary part of the vehicle` `, caused by` `theft or robbery of the part` `, for` 6_000_000
`a remote stolen` MEANS `a part replaced:` "remote control" `, of kind` `a key or remote control` `, caused by` `theft or robbery of the part` `, for` 1_500_000
`a theft of a mirror and a remote` MEANS
    `an event on` (YMD 2026 6 15) `: peril` `theft of parts of the vehicle` `, sudden` TRUE `, at` `in Vietnam` `, war` FALSE `, deliberate` EMPTY
        `, hired out` FALSE `, inspection` `a valid inspection certificate` `, load` `a normal load`
        `, parts` (LIST `a mirror stolen`, `a remote stolen`)
        `, paint` NOTHING `, police suspension` FALSE `, earlier part thefts` 0
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`a standard claim under` (`the standard policy with` (LIST `BVVC04 (theft of parts)`)) `for` `a theft of a mirror and a remote` `,` `nobody driving`) EQUALS 2_600_000
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`a standard claim under` `the standard policy` `for` `a theft of a mirror and a remote` `,` `nobody driving`) EQUALS 0

§§ `BVVC05: car hire`

GIVEN `the clauses` IS A LIST OF `A supplementary clause`
      `the costs`   IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A `A claim`
`the standard collision under clauses` `the clauses` `, hiring a car at` `the costs` MEANS
    `a claim: vehicle` `the standard vehicle` `, policy` (`the standard policy with` `the clauses`) `, claimant` `the insured named on the certificate`
        `, event` `the standard collision` `, driving` `the standard driving` `, conduct` `prompt and proper conduct`
        `, shortfall` `no premium shortfall` `, costs` `no costs` `, hire` (`car hire costing` `the costs`) `, wreck` `no wreck kept` `, other insurance` EMPTY

-- 800,000 a day and 8,000,000 an event. Ten days at 1,000,000: 10 x 800,000 = 8m, less 3 x
-- 800,000 = 2.4m, is 5.6m. Fifteen days: 12m - 2.4m = 9.6m, capped at 8m. Three days: 0.
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`the standard collision under clauses` (LIST `BVVC05 (car hire during repair)`) `, hiring a car at` (replicate 10 1_000_000)) EQUALS 21_600_000
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`the standard collision under clauses` (LIST `BVVC05 (car hire during repair)`) `, hiring a car at` (replicate 15 1_000_000)) EQUALS 24_000_000
