§ `Tests — costs (10.2) and double insurance (8)`

GIVEN `the costs` IS A `The expenses`
      `the others` IS A LIST OF `Another insurance of the vehicle`
GIVETH A `A claim`
`the standard collision with costs` `the costs` `and other insurance` `the others` MEANS
    `a claim: vehicle` `the standard vehicle` `, policy` `the standard policy` `, claimant` `the insured named on the certificate`
        `, event` `the standard collision` `, driving` `the standard driving` `, conduct` `prompt and proper conduct`
        `, shortfall` `no premium shortfall` `, costs` `the costs` `, hire` NOTHING `, wreck` `no wreck kept` `, other insurance` `the others`

-- 2m to prevent further damage, 70m of towing capped at 10% of 600m: 62m on top of 16m.
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`the standard collision with costs` (`costs: at the insurer's request` TRUE `, preventing further damage` 2_000_000 `, rescue and towing` 70_000_000) `and other insurance` EMPTY) EQUALS 78_000_000
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`the standard collision with costs` (`costs: at the insurer's request` FALSE `, preventing further damage` 2_000_000 `, rescue and towing` 70_000_000) `and other insurance` EMPTY) EQUALS 16_000_000
