#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`the standard collision with costs` `no costs` `and other insurance` (LIST (`Another insurance of the vehicle` WITH `the sum insured under it` IS 400_000_000, `on the same conditions as this contract` IS TRUE))) EQUALS 9_600_000

§ `Tests — the layers together`

-- A natural catastrophe while driving, on a vehicle insured for 480m of 600m, with BVVC03 and a
-- 1m deductible on the certificate; the insurer told after 8 hours; 2m spent at its request.
-- Parts: the drowned engine repaired (40m), the door (8m), the bumper (8.5m after 15%): 56.5m.
-- Pro-rated by 0.8: 45.2m, of which the flood part 32m bears the flood deductible of 3.2m;
-- then the 10% reduction: 37.8m; then the 1m deductible: 36.8m; plus the 2m: 38.8m.
`the layered claim` MEANS
    `a claim: vehicle` `the standard vehicle`
        `, policy` (`a 2026 policy with sum insured` 480_000_000 `, deductible` (JUST 1_000_000) `, clauses` (LIST `BVVC03 (flood damage)`))
        `, claimant` `the insured named on the certificate`
        `, event` (`a sudden` `a natural catastrophe beyond human control` `on 15 June 2026, damaging` (LIST `an engine drowned while driving, repaired for 40 million`, `a door repaired for 8 million`, `a bumper replaced for 10 million`))
        `, driving` `the standard driving`
        `, conduct` (`conduct: told after hours` (JUST 8) `, written notice after days` (JUST 2) `, force majeure` FALSE `, moved without consent` FALSE `, for safety` FALSE `, repaired without consent` FALSE `, dishonest` FALSE `, 15.1.3 rate` NOTHING)
        `, shortfall` `no premium shortfall`
        `, costs` (`costs: at the insurer's request` TRUE `, preventing further damage` 2_000_000 `, rescue and towing` 0)
        `, hire` NOTHING `, wreck` `no wreck kept` `, other insurance` EMPTY

#ASSERT `the cover decision for` `the layered claim` EQUALS `covered under` `10.1.3 a natural catastrophe beyond human control`
#ASSERT `the settlement of` `the layered claim` EQUALS `a covered loss settled as` `10.1.3 a natural catastrophe beyond human control` `a partial loss (13.1)` 36_800_000 2_000_000 0
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` `the layered claim` EQUALS 38_800_000
